# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The v4.8 site was a single URL, so there are no deep links to preserve — but
# these cover the shapes people and old bookmarks are most likely to try.
#
# Every page is built as `<route>.html` (`about.html`, `account.html`), so
# Cloudflare serves `/about` directly and redirects `/about/` back to it. Never
# add a rule that rewrites a page to or from its slash form (for example
# `/account/*  /account  200`): Pages already normalizes those, and a rule
# pointing the other way loops until the browser gives up ("cannot follow more
# than 20 redirections" on refresh).

/index.html            /                                      301
/home                  /                                      301
/about-the-institute   /about                                 301
/the-advo-difference   /advo-difference                       301
/difference            /advo-difference                       301
/board                 /board-of-directors                    301
/events                /seminars                              301
/seminar/*             /seminars/:splat                       301
/certification/level-1 /certification/advo-level-1            301
/certification/level-2 /certification/advo-level-2            301
/cert-l1               /certification/advo-level-1            301
/cert-l2               /certification/advo-level-2            301
/conference            /seminars/annual-conference-2026       301
/annual-conference     /seminars/annual-conference-2026       301
/intro                 /seminars/intro-to-advo                301
/seminars/advo-intensive-west       /seminars/advo-intensive       301
/seminars/advo-intensive-west/*     /seminars/advo-intensive/:splat 301
/internships           /seminars/internships                  301
/articles-research     /articles                              301

